# Persistent logging is how panel failures get diagnosed: keep it on across a factory reset, capped at
# 4 x 50 MB so it can never fill /data. A system rc runs as init, which may set the logd properties
# (vendor_init may not).
on property:sys.boot_completed=1
    setprop persist.logd.logpersistd.size 4
    setprop persist.logd.logpersistd.buffer all
    setprop persist.logd.logpersistd logcatd
